---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Kit-Bin" description="What Kit-Bin is and why it's free.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">About</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
      Kit-Bin is a collection of free file conversion and processing tools that run entirely in
      your browser. There's no server involved in the actual conversion work — your device does
      it, so your files never leave it. The site is free to use and pays for itself through
      display ads, which is why you'll see them here rather than a subscription paywall.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
